        {
          "title": "Nemotron ColEmbed V2: Top-Performing Late Interaction Embedding Models for Visual Document Retrieval",
          "title_zh": "Nemotron ColEmbed V2：面向视觉文档检索的顶级晚交互嵌入模型",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.03992v2",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "models_embeddings",
          "organization": "NVIDIA",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2602.03992",
          "summary": "Nemotron ColEmbed V2 is a family of vision-language embedding models at 3B, 4B and 8B parameters, built on Eagle 2 with a Llama 3.2 3B backbone and Qwen3-VL backbones, for visual document retrieval. The 8B model ranks first on the ViDoRe V3 leaderboard as of February 3, 2026 with average NDCG@10 of 63.42, and the work details cluster-based sampling, hard-negative mining, late interaction and model merging.",
